                        <tr>
                           <td>CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count is within the normal range, indicating no evidence of CD4+ lymphopenia. From a laboratory perspective, there are no abnormalities detected in this result. Clinical correlation is recommended if immunodeficiency or other immune-related conditions are suspected.</td>
